---
// Home 4 Dark Glass Customer Testimonials
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-28 bg-[#0D0E15] border-b border-white/5 text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-14 sm:mb-18">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-950/80 border border-purple-800/60 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-purple-300 mb-4">
        <span>Proven Enterprise Outcomes</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight font-['Plus_Jakarta_Sans'] leading-[1.12]">
        Trusted by high-growth revenue leaders
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        See how teams turn conversational velocity into measurable business ROI.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Dark Glass Testimonial Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-3xl p-7 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            "NewRelay cut our customer response times from 3 hours to 4 minutes across WhatsApp. We doubled our Google reviews and increased sales conversions by 40%."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/673442f44c948080a43e913b/673592bcb033b09ad5f3ed3f_user-1.png" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-400/30" alt="Elena Rostova" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Elena Rostova</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">VP Operations, SwiftRetail</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-purple-500/50 rounded-3xl p-7 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(124,58,237,0.15)] relative">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-200 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            "Our agents close 35% more high-value buyer inquiries because NewRelay routes leads to the right agent in under 20 seconds. The collision detection is unmatched."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/673442f44c948080a43e913b/673592bcafb16ca7bb760d97_user-2.png" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-400/30" alt="Julian Thorne" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Julian Thorne</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Co-Founder, Crestline Homes</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#12131F] border border-white/10 hover:border-purple-500/40 rounded-3xl p-7 transition-all flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-normal">
            "Patients love booking and confirming appointments on WhatsApp. Our no-show rate dropped by 42% in month one, and collecting Google reviews is completely on autopilot."
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/673442f44c948080a43e913b/673592bc40140078962527b6_user-3.png" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover border border-purple-400/30" alt="Dr. Clara Vance" />
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white">Dr. Clara Vance</h4>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Clinic Director, Lumina Health</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>
